  "goodToKnow": "Das Vorwort is a preface or foreword: ein Vorwort schreiben. Its partner at the end is das Nachwort (afterword). Note the plural: die Vorworte, not Vorwörter. German distinguishes Wörter (single words, as in a dictionary) and Worte (connected words, statements): ein paar Worte sagen. Prefaces belong to the Worte family. In German grammar, a preposition is eine Präposition, though some old textbooks called it a Verhältniswort."
